      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{654a7d1f1870ff9faf0911e8|full_name} That makes sense! I have more problem avatars with props that are constraint driven so I'll go through and make sure their default positions n' bounds won't conflict too much with the regular avatar bounds. \n\nThe sniper having peculiar bounds is due shapekeys that mimic physics like cursed halo. I'll see if I can get away with shrinking it haha.\n\nWas the previous method for the preview scale mostly/all driven by viewball location?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
